ed Systems Intern"},{"text":"Robotics Software Intern"},{"text":"Autonomy Intern"},{"text":"Controls Engineering Intern"},{"text":"UAV Systems Intern"},{"text":"Navigation/Estimation Intern"},{"text":"Aerospace Software Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Useful supplementary areas:"},{"type":"h","text":"Control"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Control Systems"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"State Estimation"},{"text":"UAV Dynamics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Software"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Embedded C/C++"},{"text":"Real-Time Systems"},{"text":"ROS 2"},{"text":"Linux"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UAV"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PX4"},{"text":"ArduPilot"},{"text":"MAVLink"},{"text":"UAV simulation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Supporting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MATLAB/Simulink"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"Aerospace engineering fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are secondary. For this role, flight-control projects, simulation results, embedded code and real UAV/autopilot experience are much stronger evidence."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Graduates can target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight Control Software Engineer"},{"text":"UAV Software Engineer"},{"text":"Drone Software Engineer"},{"text":"Autopilot Software Engineer"},{"text":"Embedded Flight Software Engineer"},{"text":"Controls Engineer"},{"text":"UAV Controls Engineer"},{"text":"Guidance & Navigation Engineer"},{"text":"Navigation Software Engineer"},{"text":"Robotics Software Engineer"},{"text":"Autonomous Systems Engineer"},{"text":"UAV Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Embedded Systems Engineer"},{"text":"Flight Software Developer"},{"text":"Robotics Controls Engineer"},{"text":"Sensor Fusion Engineer"},{"text":"UAV Simulation Engineer"},{"text":"Aerospace Software Engineer"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in Ind